"Thenn-ar, called Thenn, leads Joe's old lab on Moon Thegund."
"She is a very petite Artonan woman with pink eyes."
"She chose to be among the last two evacuated from Moon Thegund."
"A barrier device burned her arms and chest during the demon swarm attack, and she stayed behind."
"After the System failed she taught Alden Thorn with maps and pictures."
"She regretted not sending Alden and Kibby to the lab sooner: we thought we had more time."
"Coughing blood, she sat down in the road to die and gave Alden a garbled message for Joe."
"She was Ro-den's favorite lover and found talented Thegundese people for his lab."
"She once told him: I sometimes think I love you, Ro."
